//RS     // Tower #126 scale guard. Drives `n` tasks against a capacity-1 channel so
//RS     // every send hits backpressure and must PARK until the receiver drains it.
//RS     // Deterministic (no rustc, no wall-clock thresholds) and it fails on the three
//RS     // audited failure modes:
//RS     //   * lost wake / deadlock  → the watchdog trips instead of hanging forever,
//RS     //   * busy-wait             → zero real condvar blocks recorded,
//RS     //   * waiter leak           → send/recv waiter vectors are not drained.
